{"product_id":"over-bethnall-green","title":"Over Bethnall Green","description":"\u003cp\u003eJessie Warner has married Tom Smith and their baby is almost due. Settling down into their new home in Bethnal Green, Jessie looks forward to her new life - even though Tom is continually getting into mischief that borders on the downright criminal.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBut then the grim outside world intrudes. When war begins and Tom is called up almost at once, Jessie is left to cope with the baby alone. Jessie's twin, Hannah, has been recruited to help at Bletchley Park and, immersed in her work decoding German messages, has no idea of Jessie's desperation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBut things are about to get worse. When Tom does a runner and goes AWOL, Jessie will be left in a dire situation . . .\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Sally Worboyes \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781473673663 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43520569802905,"sku":"14RC9781473673663","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/5eb06cd1c17cfd5a46ac210dcbdea05c.jpg?v=1698142425","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/over-bethnall-green","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}